    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration} without expending a spell slot and without preparing it, as long as you use Alchemist's Supplies as the Spellcasting Focus. You can do so a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nisG9LQieGwAskD2\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend a use, then cast Lesser Restoration from the compendium without a slot.</p></section>",
